---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getSiteContent } from '../lib/content';
const content = await getSiteContent();
const { settings } = content;
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact OICL for research exchange and collaboration." active="contact" content={content}>
  <section class="page-hero shell"><span class="eyebrow">OICL / 交流与招聘</span><h1>Contact<span>.</span></h1><p>We welcome conversations about optical communications, AI computing and research collaboration.</p></section>
  <section class="section shell contact-grid"><div class="contact-primary"><span class="eyebrow">REACH THE LAB</span><h2>Exchange ideas.<br />Explore possibilities.</h2>{settings.contactEmail ? <a class="contact-email" href={`mailto:${settings.contactEmail}`}>{settings.contactEmail} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> : <p>The contact address will be published after verification.</p>}<p>For research exchange, please include a short introduction and the topic you would like to discuss.</p></div><div class="contact-side"><div><span class="eyebrow">LABORATORY</span><h3>{settings.officialName || settings.labName}</h3>{settings.chineseName && <p lang="zh-CN">{settings.chineseName}</p>}</div><div><span class="eyebrow">AFFILIATION</span><p>{settings.affiliation || 'Details in preparation'}</p>{settings.location && <p>{settings.location}</p>}</div><div><span class="eyebrow">RECRUITMENT</span><p>Prospective students and researchers may contact the lab to ask about opportunities. Specific openings will be listed when confirmed.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
